            <p>It takes about what pushing a standard push lawnmower takes, and the V-brush height dial decides most of it. If you set the brushes too low into dense turf, it will require more effort; setting the dial slightly higher allows it to glide smoothly while still gathering leaves and twigs effortlessly.</p>
